## Port of pumpkin/src/block/viewer.rs
## `ViewerCountTracker` is pumpkin-world's, in src/inventory/viewer.aowl, and `update_viewer_count` is in containers.aowl:
## two modules called `viewer` cannot be compiled together, so this one holds nothing of its own.
## `ViewerFuture` is async plumbing and has no counterpart. `ViewerCountListener` is the three procs `onContainerOpen`,
## `onContainerClose` and `onViewerCountUpdate` that `updateViewerCount` finds for the entity's type.

